id: VS-07
name: Risk Monitoring
short_description: Keep risk posture current through indicators and breach workflows;
  trigger timely mitigation and escalation.
owner: null
stakeholders:
- Ops leaders, Risk Owners, Risk Function, ExCo/Board
triggers:
- KRI/KCI thresholds, anomaly detection, operational events, emerging risk signals.
inputs:
- Appetite thresholds (VS-00), monitoring data feeds, incident signals, control health,
  supplier performance.
entry_criteria: ''
key_activities:
- 1) Define/maintain KRIs/KCIs linked to risks and appetite
- 2) Build data pipelines and freshness checks
- 3) Monitor dashboards and alerts
- 4) Correlate signals and triage breaches
- 5) Escalate and launch mitigations
- 6) Update risk ratings or confidence
- 7) Track recurrence and false alerts
- 8) Improve indicator set and thresholds.
decisions_and_gates: []
outputs:
- Indicator catalogue, live dashboards, breach logs, mitigation actions, updated risk
  posture.
exit_criteria: ''
metrics: 'Flow: time to detect/acknowledge/escalate; throughput of breach triage.<br>Performance:
  false alert rate; data freshness compliance.<br>Risk: breach recurrence; % leading
  indicators; residual movement triggered by evidence.'
source_file: docs\value-architecture\value-streams\VS-07-risk-monitoring.md
last_updated: '2026-02-01T12:57:43.679467Z'
